OL,3,GNEWSAYoung people in Wales need
OL,4,Asupport, says youth training sector
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe youth training sector wants the
OL,7,FWelsh government to reveal its plans to
OL,8,Fsupport young people in Wales who are
OL,9,Fnot in education, employment or
OL,10,Ftraining (Neet).
OL,12,FThe Enterprise Minister Adam Price told
OL,13,Fa Senedd committee last month that the
OL,14,FYoung Persons' Guarantee - a policy
OL,15,Funder the previous Labour Welsh
OL,16,Fgovernment - has "not worked to the
OL,17,Fextent that is necessary", adding that
OL,18,F"new ideas" were needed.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
