OL,3,GNEWSAYoung people in Wales need
OL,4,Asupport, says youth training sector
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut there are concerns from those
OL,7,Fworking in the sector that delaying any
OL,8,Fdecisions will lead to an increase in
OL,9,Fthe numbers of Neets.
OL,11,FThe Welsh government said it hoped to
OL,12,Fannounce details of its new plan in the
OL,13,Fcoming weeks.
